WEBVTT

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.130
You're at your grandpa's house right now?

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.400
Whatever, come over right away.

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:57.240
What? You can't?

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.490
Oh, I see. I understand.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:00.870
Come over, right now!

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.390
No talking back, come here now!

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.410
Get here within 15 minutes.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:15.950
Who were you talking to on the phone?

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:16.770
Uchida.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:17.930
Uchida?

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:20.360
I thought she went back to her hometown.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.850
Yeah.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.200
Did you just call her over to our house?

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.300
So, what about it?

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:29.550
No... Nevermind.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.990
Dad, the kite got stuck on the wire.

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:36.570
Ah, now you've done it, Tomo-kun. Should I get mad at you?

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:38.950
So... boring.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:44.130
What do you think you're doing?

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.160
Don't act like you're the only one doing something meaningful.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.920
You totally lack what people call harmony.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:51.460
Then why don't you go and do your homework?

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:56.640
Hey, what's wrong? What happened to the harmony you spoke of? Harmony.

00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:59.680
Is that even important now?

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.940
Everyone in the world is having a blast now due to the start of the New Year.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:08.260
On the other hand, everyone here is sitting around without a goal, just like bears in hibernation.

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:11.510
That's right. Wouldn't that be no different than Fujioka here?

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.490
Then what's your goal?

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.760
Oh, well... I'll think about it later.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.900
Stop being so nosy if you don't have a goal yourself, you idiot!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.960
Daddy, the kite got stuck.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.900
My my, you've done it now,Yuki-chan.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.310
Well well, this is what New Year is all about, right?

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.130
Speaking of which, what are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:39.780
When it comes to New Year, you can't rule out praying at the shrine and watching the New Year's sunrise.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.540
The events one can spend with a lover are limitless.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.260
Uh... Kana, do you want some tea?

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.870
Haruka-chan... Me too...

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:51.470
What are you doing here drinking tea? Go hang out with your girlfriend!

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:56.060
Can't you tell? He's here only because he has no plans?

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:01.010
We initially had something planned. It was so hard to get Reiko-san to go.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:07.210
But then, suddenly she canceled the date. She didn't even answer my calls.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:08.440
How vexing.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:09.500
Are you talking about yourself?

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:19.220
Just like any other New Year, we now have a Red versus White hidden talent competition!

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.420
We're finally in the semis. Now let us...

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.260
Unacceptable.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.810
How ridiculous. Only talent shows on New Year's Day.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.920
Don't they have anything better to show?

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.760
Really? I think they're quite interesting.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.150
Then why don't you put on a show for me?

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:32.270
What?

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:33.260
Talent show.

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:36.210
Wait... Why do I have to perform?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.690
I want to see.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:40.610
Since you find it so interesting, let us see an interesting performance.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.420
Let's give a round of applause for Haruka's talent show.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.330
I can't do that...

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:47.570
Right?

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:54.580
Oh, this is because... I didn't mean to...

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.520
Wait a moment.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:02.990
I'm looking forward to it, Chiaki.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:05.960
I'm so sorry, Haruka-neesama.

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:17.930
Okay then...

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:21.860
Coming.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.320
Happy New Year!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:27.860
Is there something you want?

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.280
Something?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.470
Wasn't it you who called us over this morning?

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.330
That's right. You told us to "come right away".

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:37.020
What's with that getup?

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.990
That's our line.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.180
Eh? It's a new year.

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:46.340
So I thought I'd use this chance to stop being Mako-chan, and just be a normal boy.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.350
Come again after you fix it.

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:51.980
Why am I in this too?

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.110
Coming.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:00.290
Happy New Year!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.510
Happy New Year...

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:05.800
Just born from the animal kingdom at the end of last year.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.590
In the end, I still had to dress up.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:12.610
It can't be helped, Kana only allows Mako-chan to come in.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:16.100
And here I thought I could revert back this year.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.760
Continuing like this isn't that bad, actually.

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.740
That's because it doesn't concern you.

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.120
This isn't that bad, actually.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:23.920
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:35.560
What the heck are you doing? There are guests here.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.310
Pull back!

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.900
Please take care of me this year, Touma and Mako-chan.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.030
Ah, please take care of me.

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:46.190
Please take care of me this year too.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.020
What was that just now?

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.690
Don't think too much about it.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:54.080
I was just a bit sleep deprived, really.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.410
Sorry, Haruka.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:09.620
Huh? Kana, did you take a bite out of my cake?

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:13.380
What are you saying? Is that something you should say to someone who's depressed?

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:16.160
But... Besides you, who would...

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.160
Huh?

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:24.520
My notebook is missing. How is this possible? It was still here a minute ago...

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:28.260
This kind of thing must not be seen by anyone else.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.900
Always having it with me is working against me.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.420
Calm down. I can't cause a commotion.

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:35.120
I've got to act like nothing's happened.

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.950
Under the kotatsu.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:37.970
What? What?

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.200
What's wrong, Chiaki? You are being fidgety.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.250
I'm not fidgeting.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:45.080
Are you in a bad mood because you didn't get enough New Year's gifts?

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:49.980
The details of my New Year's gifts are all written in the notebook.

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.110
Did he see it?

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.220
Is he making fun of me because he has seen it?

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.880
No, if Chiaki's in a foul mood,

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:57.330
then it must be that thing from the end of the year.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.520
You know, <i>that</i>...

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.440
That?

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:03.000
The thing from the end of the year, she must be referring to <i>that</i>.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.100
Can't be... But...

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:09.060
Chiaki, you haven't finished your cake.
Is it because there's something else you want to eat?

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:10.140
Haruka-neesama, I wrote that down too.  Even though cake isn't bad,

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:11.640
She came out.

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.170
Chiaki? Chiaki?

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:17.230
but I also want to eat yellow rice cake, served with brown sugar syrup!

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.440
No, this is bad.

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:24.580
I'm starting to suspect everyone.

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:28.780
What should I do?

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:31.010
Just where did you go, my notebook?

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:41.640
Fujioka, so it was you who kept it for me.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.730
Which means, you're the one who took it away?

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:54.940
My dessert has gotten smaller. Who ate it?!

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.180
Stop pretending, you ate it yourself.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.820
Shut up! Let me have yours!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:06.350
It's not good to suspect other people.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.310
What's gotten into you?

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.670
What's wrong, Chiaki?

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:10.590
It's not good!

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.370
I'm full.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:31.740
Thank you for the food.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.770
It's nothing much.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:38.780
But really...

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.820
It makes me itch when there's nothing to do.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:42.980
Right?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.620
You're talking to me?

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:46.680
Do you want to go kite flying?

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:49.160
That's why I say you're still an amateur.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.550
But, I want to go on a trip.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.750
Then let's go somewhere.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.030
Go ahead.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.920
But we don't have any transportation to go on a trip.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:00.430
I've bought some refreshments.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.340
Eh? What is it?

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:27.090
Sorry for the trouble, Uncle. Since it's New Year's Day and all.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:31.530
It's all right. It's more productive than just spending time at home anyway.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:35.050
Especially since no one is going out with you.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.910
M–My bad. I won't bring it up again.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.680
Since everyone's lives are at stake.

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:58.440
I'm sorry. Kana isn't very sensitive about other people's problems.

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:02.430
Nah, it's not a big deal. I've given it some thought.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.200
Nothing good is going to happen if you keep dwelling on it.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.210
I will use this holiday as a chance to begin anew...

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:07.880
Turn left.

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:08.530
Turning left.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.660
Fujioka-kun... Right?

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.310
Why's he coming with us?

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:19.250
Oh, Kana called him, she said we might as well bring him.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:23.590
Hmm, looks like his relationship with Kana-chan is pretty close.

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:25.130
What kind of relationship do they have?

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.370
Hmm, him and Kana...

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:28.650
Turn left.

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:29.220
Turning left.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:35.690
Haruka-chan, next up is another left turn, right?

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:39.130
No, well... I wonder.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:41.940
Hey, we still haven't reached our destination?

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:44.360
I think we're almost there.

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.420
No problems, right?

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:50.120
There were many signs along the way...

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:53.120
Something about 'Be careful of icy roads', 'Do not enter'...

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:56.370
Those are warning signs... Haruka-neesama.

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.500
We turn left next, right?

00:11:58.500 --> 00:11:59.810
Yeah, probably...

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:00.580
Wait–

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:04.380
Let's ask that person over there for directions.

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:14.330
Seems like there's a hot spring resort 20km from here with very few people.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:19.080
Good! Let's go to the hot spring!

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.190
Yes!

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:23.510
Hey, Kana. I haven't heard about this.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.430
About what?

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.120
What's this about a hot spring? You never told me.

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.450
I haven't told you?

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:32.000
Are Touma and I going to the male bath or the female bath?

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.050
Just go to any side.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:35.830
Take a soak in the hot bath before getting soaked by it!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.550
Of course, you idiot!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.000
It feels good.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.090
Hot springs are really great, aren't they?

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:57.180
Just as you say, Haruka-neesama.

00:12:57.180 --> 00:13:01.520
It's been a while since we came to a hot spring on New Year's Day, it's like we've reserved the entire resort.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:06.170
The hot spring we risked ourselves to get to really has its own charm.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:08.580
This is what a secret hot spring should be.

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:12.410
Chiaki, let's talk about the quality of the water.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.920
Is that even important now?

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.100
Then nevermind.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:26.130
This is killing me. Other than you and Kana, no one knows I'm a boy.

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:27.900
Same goes for me.

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:31.410
Fujioka thinks I'm a boy.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.050
Eh? It's not like I'm hiding this on purpose.

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:35.890
I can just enter the women's bath naturally.

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:37.700
R–Really?

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:38.790
Yup, no problem.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:39.740
Then I'll be going in.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.360
Wait, Touma.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:46.760
Then what should I do? If I don't go to the bath with everyone, it would seem awkward, right?

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:47.530
What should I do?

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.900
Shut up! Deal with it yourself.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.190
How can you do that? That's not fair!

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:59.200
Thanks for bringing us here.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.980
Oh, it's nothing. I'm gonna rest here for a bit.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.450
Why don't you go use the bath?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.540
Okay, then I shall.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:08.670
What's your relationship with Kana-chan?

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.690
Let go!

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:17.160
No, don't leave me here!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.980
Just go back to your room!

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:20.650
Why do you have to say that?

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:22.050
Let go! Geez...

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:23.070
What are you guys doing?

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.570
Um... About that...

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:29.100
You want to work up a sweat before you take a bath?

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:32.950
You guys aren't going in the hot spring?

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.780
Uh... Yeah, a bit later.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:40.400
I see! I was just thinking about doing other fun things aside from the hot spring.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.200
Let's go!

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:52.310
What would there be...
Everything is covered in snow during this season.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:55.190
There's got to be something! There has to be!

00:14:55.190 --> 00:15:03.730
Let's see... If you go behind the mountain, there's a natural spring with clean water.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:08.240
Not bad, spring water. It's the perfect thing for cooling down my hot body.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:11.700
Is she planning to drink it in such cold weather?

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:12.500
Is she serious?

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:18.450
Are we there yet, Haruka?

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:21.630
Hmm, I think we're getting there.

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:24.120
Could it be that Haruka is bad at reading maps?

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:28.720
We're not lost.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:29.840
So we're lost?

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.460
This is quite a magnificent spring.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.230
It's more like overflowing instead of gushing out.

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:45.400
Then let's call it overflowing water.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:49.340
I see... Overflowing water. So it's overflowing water!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.100
No, this is a waterfall.

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:54.600
I'm sorry, I got us lost!

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:57.190
I'm sorry, Haruka-neesama.

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:59.830
The finishing blow was actually delivered by Chiaki.

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.620
What an unexpected turn of events.

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:03.460
I'm freezing. Let's head back.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:12.300
My cold body is all warmed up again.

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:15.300
This feeling isn't bad at all...

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:16.800
This is paradise.

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:21.910
My body is cold and stiff from being out there for so long.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.310
I want to hurry up and use the spring.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:27.020
Only you get to enjoy it, you're so unfair.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:34.010
So, in the end, what exactly is your relationship with Kana-chan?

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:37.570
Let me go! I'm going!

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:38.730
What're you guys doing?

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.840
The water is just right.

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:43.530
We've already finished bathing.

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:45.490
Why don't you go have a dip, Mako-chan?

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:49.200
That's right. Now...

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:53.740
Hold it, Mako-chan. Which bath do you plan on using?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.670
Well... It's not a problem anymore if we go now.

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:57.800
It IS a problem!

00:16:58.270 --> 00:17:00.470
What's wrong? You're not going in?

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:02.260
Uh, well...

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:04.060
Then let's play some table tennis! Table tennis!

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:10.330
Chiaki, here I come!

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:14.680
What's wrong? It was out.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.440
I'm not done yet!

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:19.230
Out!

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:20.570
Server change. Chiaki to serve.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:27.010
Home run! One out!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.540
It's out, you idiot!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.640
Do those two really want to play?

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:36.420
More importantly, I really want to go use the bath.

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.420
Here I come, Chiaki.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.800
Yes, Haruka-neesama!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:47.810
Come!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.770
Haruka-neesama, are you serious?

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:55.810
Am I the only one that feels Haruka hasn't grasped the situation?

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:57.920
Haruka-san is so good at table tennis.

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.330
Now, who's up next?

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:07.660
I feel like I'm floating.

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:13.000
Good, it's done! Oh~Hot spring house. Hot spring house. Hot spring house.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.040
Idiot.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:17.120
Then you come and make it, Chiaki.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:18.880
Is that even important now?

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:22.390
Then nevermind.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:26.630
Since it has come to this, let's just do it.

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:27.630
It'll all work out somehow.

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:31.640
I'll go in the men's bath, you go in the women's bath, right?

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:33.360
Correct. Good luck to you.

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:39.580
There're many different kinds of friends.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.690
Ah, right! Why don't you use the bath?

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.850
Oh, and what is your relationship with Chiaki-chan?

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.440
Ah, go use the bath.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.580
I'm sorry! I got it mixed up!

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:08.660
I can finally use the bath.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.450
Fujioka, why are you...

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:16.480
Ah, Touma. I had a big surprise.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:19.280
I thought it was the men's bath but Mako-chan was there...

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:21.200
I'll have to apologize to her later.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.360
That's right. Fujioka doesn't know Makoto is a boy.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.910
So he thinks this is the men's bath.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:31.070
This is bad. Right now, Chiaki and the others are bathing.

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:34.370
If this continues, Fujioka will become a peeping tom.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.460
No, if he goes in there casually, then it's not considered peeping.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:41.340
What do you call a pervert who just walks in casually?

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:42.600
Ah, just a pervert is good enough.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:46.010
More importantly, what should I do now?

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:50.140
F–Fujioka! Wait! Wait!

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:54.510
Listen, Fujioka. There are two types of outdoor baths in this place.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:56.430
In order for people to fully enjoy both types,

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:58.790
they periodically switch the men's and women's bath.

00:19:58.790 --> 00:19:59.780
Is that true?

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:04.600
Right now, they're preparing for the switch.
So the other side will become the men's bath in just a bit.

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.000
I'll go check it out.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.010
Makoto, you there?

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:20.430
At any rate, you need to do something about your hairstyle.

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:22.420
Damn, I forgot! We caught a break!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:28.500
Good. Now it won't be a problem if Fujioka comes.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:31.090
You are just some dumb kid who happens to be here.

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:34.630
I got it. I'm just some dumb kid who happens to be here...

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.520
Is the 'dumb' part even necessary?

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.730
I'm feeling dizzy.

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:45.900
I'm going out to check if there's any coffee milk or something.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:48.690
What? You're finished already?

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.150
Two outdoor baths, huh?

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.810
I guess I'll take a look before it changes into the women's bath.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.340
What're you doing, you idiot?!

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:12.050
Sorry. I think I'll stay here for another hour at least.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:15.480
Then you can just live here.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.050
Oh, Chiaki...

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:18.120
Hmm?

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:24.900
Just for example... If you see a half-naked guy in the girl's change room, what would you say?

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:33.010
Is that even important now?

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:36.250
How come... The bath on that side...

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:39.980
The periodic switch between the two baths...

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:45.270
Huh? Eh? Why?

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:46.400
Why...

00:21:58.030 --> 00:21:59.180
Why...

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:34.660
Originally in Italy, you got to choose between soup and pasta as an appetizer.

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:38.050
That's why, for convenience, both forks and spoons are prepared.

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:39.810
It doesn't mean you should use both.

00:23:39.810 --> 00:23:43.490
Americans make the mistake of using both,
and the ones who copied them were the Japanese.

00:23:43.490 --> 00:23:45.850
Don't just imitate everything you see, you idiot!
